 "mode": "flow",
 "duration": 172.058,
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "This is this week's Fortnite Item Shop! Every big bundle, every new drop, and every OG that came back.",
   "t0": 0.2,
   "t1": 5.435
  },
  {
   "text": "Six days of the shop, from October 28th to November 2nd, straight from Epic's own Item Shop data.",
   "t0": 5.735,
   "t1": 10.83
  },
  {
   "text": "Let's get into it!",
   "t0": 11.13,
   "t1": 11.84
  },
  {
   "text": "First, the biggest bundle of the whole week.",
   "t0": 12.24,
   "t1": 14.01
  },
  {
   "text": "The Five Nights at Freddy's Bundle!",
   "t0": 14.31,
   "t1": 15.709
  },
  {
   "text": "Freddy Fazbear, Foxy, Chica, Bonnie, and more. Eighteen items in total.",
   "t0": 15.959,
   "t1": 19.774
  },
  {
   "text": "Listed at 11,000 V-Bucks, it sold for 4,500.",
   "t0": 20.064,
   "t1": 23.364
  },
  {
   "text": "It was in the shop until October 31st, so if you missed it, it's gone for now.",
   "t0": 23.664,
   "t1": 27.099
  },
  {
   "text": "Now, the new stuff. These all went live this week.",
   "t0": 27.499,
   "t1": 29.809
  },
  {
   "text": "The Adventure Time Bundle landed today, November 2nd!",
   "t0": 30.109,
   "t1": 32.51
  },
  {
   "text": "Finn the Human, Jake the Dog, Princess Bubblegum, Marceline, and more. Thirteen items.",
   "t0": 32.76,
   "t1": 37.165
  },
  {
   "text": "It's 3,800 V-Bucks, listed at 10,300, and it's in the shop until November 6th.",
   "t0": 37.465,
   "t1": 42.4
  },
  {
   "text": "Right next to it, the Ice King and Lemongrab Bundle. 3,200 V-Bucks, listed at 5,400.",
   "t0": 42.7,
   "t1": 48.565
  },
  {
   "text": "On November 1st, the One Piece Bundle dropped.",
   "t0": 48.965,
   "t1": 51.22
  },
  {
   "text": "Monkey D. Luffy, Nami, and Usopp, fifteen items, for 4,000 V-Bucks, listed at 8,200.",
   "t0": 51.52,
   "t1": 57.49
  },
  {
   "text": "And this one sticks around. It's in the shop until December 3rd!",
   "t0": 57.785,
   "t1": 61.015
  },
  {
   "text": "Same day, the Mariah Carey Bundle arrived. 2,800 V-Bucks, listed at 4,300, until November 4th.",
   "t0": 61.415,
   "t1": 67.99
  },
  {
   "text": "And today, Harley Quinn is back too, with her own bundle for 2,000 V-Bucks.",
   "t0": 68.42,
   "t1": 72.435
  },
  {
   "text": "Halloween week brought the horror icons.",
   "t0": 72.835,
   "t1": 74.82
  },
  {
   "text": "On October 28th, the A Nightmare on Elm Street Bundle came in, with Freddy Krueger, for 2,300 V-Bucks.",
   "t0": 75.07,
   "t1": 81.05
  },
  {
   "text": "On October 31st, the Ripley and Xenomorph Bundle, for 2,200.",
   "t0": 81.35,
   "t1": 85.245
  },
  {
   "text": "And the Predator: Badlands Bundle, with Dek, for 2,000 V-Bucks.",
   "t0": 85.545,
   "t1": 88.884
  },
  {
   "text": "Plus two five-outfit bundles, Grave The Day and Hero Horde, 3,500 V-Bucks each, listed at 7,500. Those were in the shop until October 30th.",
   "t0": 89.134,
   "t1": 98.409
  },
  {
   "text": "If you're grabbing any of these, use code BAD in the Item Shop. It really helps the channel.",
   "t0": 98.809,
   "t1": 102.999
  },
  {
   "text": "A few big collabs also left the shop this week.",
   "t0": 103.399,
   "t1": 105.728
  },
  {
   "text": "The Shadow the Hedgehog and Knuckles the Echidna Bundle, 3,600 V-Bucks, was in the shop until October 31st.",
   "t0": 105.978,
   "t1": 112.153
  },
  {
   "text": "The Yeat Bundle, also 3,600, left the same day.",
   "t0": 112.453,
   "t1": 115.683
  },
  {
   "text": "And the Doja Cat Bundle, 3,200 V-Bucks, was in the shop until October 30th.",
   "t0": 115.983,
   "t1": 121.463
  },
  {
   "text": "Now, the OGs!",
   "t0": 121.863,
   "t1": 122.579
  },
  {
   "text": "Commando and Shadow Ops, both from Chapter 1, Season 1, were in the shop every single day this week.",
   "t0": 122.829,
   "t1": 127.689
  },
  {
   "text": "Commando is 800 V-Bucks. Shadow Ops is 1,500.",
   "t0": 127.989,
   "t1": 131.949
  },
  {
   "text": "Snowstrike, from Chapter 1, Season 7, was there all week too.",
   "t0": 132.249,
   "t1": 135.344
  },
  {
   "text": "Rex, from Chapter 1, Season 3, showed up for three days.",
   "t0": 135.644,
   "t1": 138.554
  },
  {
   "text": "And today, Fishstick, from Chapter 1, Season 7, is back in the shop.",
   "t0": 138.804,
   "t1": 142.059
  },
  {
   "text": "Last, what's leaving soon.",
   "t0": 142.459,
   "t1": 143.619
  },
  {
   "text": "The Ripley and Xenomorph Bundle is in the shop until November 3rd.",
   "t0": 143.919,
   "t1": 146.769
  },
  {
   "text": "Mariah Carey and Predator: Badlands, until November 4th.",
   "t0": 147.069,
   "t1": 149.859
  },
  {
   "text": "Adventure Time, Ice King and Lemongrab, and Harley Quinn, until November 6th.",
   "t0": 150.159,
   "t1": 153.814
  },
  {
   "text": "Quick recap!",
   "t0": 154.214,
   "t1": 154.818
  },
  {
   "text": "Biggest bundle of the week: Five Nights at Freddy's. Newest: Adventure Time. The one that stays the longest: One Piece.",
   "t0": 155.069,
   "t1": 160.369
  },
  {
   "text": "And Commando and Shadow Ops never left.",
   "t0": 160.369,
   "t1": 162.374
  },
  {
   "text": "Which bundle did you grab this week? Tell me in the comments!",
   "t0": 162.624,
   "t1": 165.784
  },
  {
   "text": "Use code BAD in the Item Shop. It really helps the channel.",
   "t0": 166.184,
   "t1": 168.879
  },
  {
   "text": "Thank you for watching! Follow for more daily content.",
   "t0": 169.179,
   "t1": 171.458
  }
 ],
